...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

coordinator: FinanceCoordinatorAgent { class: ours }
savings: SavingsStrategyAgent { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }
store: InMemorySessionService { class: store }

coordinator -> savings: 2번째 자식 run_async (같은 세션)
savings -> gemini: 모델 호출 (SavingsStrategy 스키마)
gemini -> savings: JSON 응답
coordinator -> store: state_delta 반영 (savings_strategy)
